# Deny the build context by default. Only files copied by Dockerfile are sent
# to the builder, which keeps local environments, outputs, and repository
# history outside the BuildKit trust boundary.
*
!.dockerignore
!Dockerfile
!LICENSE
!README.md
!alembic.ini
!pyproject.toml
!setup.py
!uv.lock
!alembic/
!alembic/**
!config/
!config/**
!control-packs/
!control-packs/**
!examples/
!examples/**
!reconforge/
!reconforge/**
